   914	    // hot site (and one binary search at the two that lack it), and membership IS
   915	    // `inten > noise`. Measured: 100% of above-noise peaks are seeds at the shipped snr of 1.0, so
   916	    // `order` was reserved at P/4 and grew by doubling to ~2P -- count first, reserve exactly.
   917	    tp.frame_live.assign(F, 0);
